      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora meets her girlfriend's mother, and has to explain how she and Glimmer met.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, Catra discovers something about herself that she hadn't expected.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
